SUMMARY:A Girl Unknown
LOCATION:BAMPFA\, 2155 Center St\, Berkeley\, CA 94704
DESCRIPTION:Born in the wake of China’s controversial one-child policy\, 
 six-year-old Juan is suddenly uprooted from her family when her mom become
 s pregnant in this achingly poignant coming-of-age story from first-time f
 eature director Zou Jing.\nhttps://bampfa.org/event/girl-unknown\nFrom Pus
 hpin Bay Area: https://pushpin.city/bayarea/
URL:https://bampfa.org/event/girl-unknown
END:VEVENT
