SUMMARY:The Dreamed Adventure
LOCATION:BAMPFA\, 2155 Center St\, Berkeley\, CA 94704
DESCRIPTION:A Bulgarian archaeologist investigates the disappearance of a f
 ormer lover in this absorbing Cannes Film Festival prizewinner. German dir
 ector Valeska Grisebach worked with a nonprofessional cast to create a slo
 w-burn thriller with the grit of a Western and the scope of Chinatown.\nht
 tps://bampfa.org/event/dreamed-adventure\nFrom Pushpin Bay Area: https://p
 ushpin.city/bayarea/
URL:https://bampfa.org/event/dreamed-adventure
